  "goodToKnow": "Die Todesstrafe is the death penalty. Article 102 of the Grundgesetz states simply: Die Todesstrafe ist abgeschafft. West Germany abolished it in 1949; East Germany only in 1987. The state constitution of Hesse still mentioned it until a 2018 referendum removed the clause, though it had long been void. Compound: der Tod (death) + s + die Strafe (punishment). Darauf steht die Todesstrafe means that crime carries the death penalty."
